                    "description": "Maintain an authoritative, versioned inventory of every installed or enabled agent skill and instruction asset across supported agent platforms. Record its canonical identifier, version and digest, source and provenance, owner, host or platform, installation path, declared permissions and capabilities, dependencies, lifecycle state, and last observed deployment. Discover the complete deployed population from agent control planes, extension registries, and relevant filesystems; reconcile it against declared records; identify unknown, duplicate, orphaned, stale, or drifted entries; preserve signed reconciliation evidence; and emit bounded findings or lifecycle triggers to the controls that own admission, retirement, containment, or eviction. OpenClaw and Claude Code skills use <code>SKILL.md</code>; Cursor agent skills also use <code>SKILL.md</code> and project rules under <code>.cursor/rules/*.mdc</code>. Apply the same inventory contract to equivalent platform-specific skill, rule, plugin, and workflow artifacts.",
